# Positronic project metadata
.positronic
AGENTS.md
# Allow ``docs/security/nanobot-policy.md`` to be copied into the image
# — the resource is read at runtime by ``osm_primitives.py``. Block
# everything else under docs/ by listing the sub-paths we don't ship.
docs/README.md
docs/*.md
docs/deployment
docs/integrations
docs/development

# Docker-specific — the catalog entry lives outside the image build
servers
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.*.yml

# Markdown
*.md
!README.md

# License
LICENSE

# GitHub metadata that may have been copied
.editorconfig
.prettierignore
.eslintrc*
